       2400 / size of tiles to be compressed                 ZTILE2  =                    1 / size of tiles to be compressed                 ZCMPTYPE= 'RICE_1  '           / compression algorithm                          ZNAME1  = 'BLOCKSIZE'          / compression block size                         ZVAL1   =                   32 / pixels per block                               ZNAME2  = 'BYTEPIX '           / bytes per pixel (1, 2, 4, or 8)                ZVAL2   =                    1 / bytes per pixel (1, 2, 4, or 8)                EXTNAME = 'BPM     '           / name of this binary table extension            EXTVER  =                    1                                                  END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀&␀␀␀<␀␀␀%␀␀␀b␀␀␀␀␀␀‡␀␀␀␀␀␀¥␀␀␀␀␀␀Ã␀␀␀␀␀␀á␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;␀␀␀␀␀Y␀␀␀␀␀w␀␀␀␀␀•␀␀␀␀␀³␀␀␀␀␀Ñ␀␀␀␀␀ï␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀+␀␀␀␀␀I␀␀␀␀␀g␀␀␀␀␀…␀␀␀␀␀£␀␀␀␀␀Á␀␀␀%␀␀ß␀␀␀&␀␀␀␀␀␀␀*␀␀␀␀␀H␀␀␀␀␀f␀␀␀␀␀„␀␀␀␀␀¢␀␀␀␀␀À␀␀␀␀␀Þ␀␀␀␀␀ü␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀8␀␀␀␀␀V␀␀␀␀␀t␀␀␀␀␀’␀␀␀␀␀°␀␀␀␀␀Î␀␀␀␀␀ì␀␀␀␀␀
